The service runs an observer, following a smart rollup node at ENDPOINT
(default http://127.0.0.1:8932). Edit #{etc}/octez/octez-evm-node.conf
before starting it, e.g. set RUNTIME_OPTS="--network mainnet
--init-from-snapshot" for a fresh data directory. For a sequencer or other
modes, run octez-evm-node yourself.
The service log, #{var}/log/octez/octez-evm-node.log, only gets warnings
(LOG_RULES in the conf file). Full logs are in <data-dir>/daily_logs.
